            <circle cx="188" cy="90" r="5"/><circle cx="212" cy="46" r="5"/>
          </g>
          <text x="150" y="176" fill="var(--tide)" font-family="IBM Plex Sans Condensed, sans-serif" font-size="10.5" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1">COVER TO COVER, BELOW THE CREST</text>
        </svg>
        <p class="sub">Rocks and treeline mark the route. A straight climb up open rock is a straight line of sight for anyone watching the slope.</p>
